---
import { AlertCircle, ShieldCheck, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="why" class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-[#081726] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#EE7B2B] tracking-wider uppercase font-semibold">
        STRATEGIC IMPERATIVE
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-['Outfit'] mt-2 tracking-tight">
        Why Domestic Refining Matters
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-300 mt-3 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        India's clean mobility targets depend on critical minerals currently controlled by foreign monopolies. Giga Mines closes the loop within national borders.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparative Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <!-- Problem Card -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-[#0D2237]/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-red-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
            <AlertCircle className="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" />
            <span>The Supply Vulnerability</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Outfit'] mb-4">
            100% Foreign Import Exposure
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Virtually all lithium, cobalt, nickel, and rare earth elements entering Indian gigafactories originate overseas, exposing OEMs to export restrictions and volatile pricing.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Import Dependency:</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">100% on key battery minerals</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Supply Chain Risk:</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">High Geopolitical Volatility</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Environmental Impact:</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">High mining carbon intensity</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution Card -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-[#0F2840] border border-[#2E87C6]/40 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg shadow-[#050E17]/50">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#EE7B2B] text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <ShieldCheck className="w-4 h-4 text-[#EE7B2B]" />
              <span>The Giga Mines Solution</span>
            </div>
            <!-- Indian Tricolor Micro-Indicator (Saffron, White, Green) -->
            <div class="flex h-1.5 w-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-slate-700/60 shadow-sm" title="India Sovereign Supply">
              <span class="w-1/3 bg-[#EE7B2B]"></span>
              <span class="w-1/3 bg-white"></span>
              <span class="w-1/3 bg-emerald-500"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Outfit'] mb-4">
            Sovereign Closed-Loop Refining
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            By recycling spent batteries and decommissioned permanent magnets domestically, Giga Mines produces high-purity chemical salts directly inside India.
          </p>

          <!-- Indian Tricolor Sequenced Metrics: Saffron (#EE7B2B), White (#FFFFFF), Green (#10B981) -->
          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 pt-4 border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Target Chemical Purity:</span>
              <span class="text-[#EE7B2B] font-bold">99.85% Battery Grade</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Carbon Intensity:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">-84% vs Virgin Mining</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Domestic Availability:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">100% Domestic Supply</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20">
          <a
            href="#partner"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-[#EE7B2B] hover:text-[#D9681A] transition-colors font-mono"
          >
            <span>DISCUSS OFFTAKE PARTNERSHIP</span>
            <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
